      "returnToBaseAfter": true,
      "from": "He wanted, badly, to have been given something. A sentence. A hand on the neck. Even a look. He was thirteen, and he had not yet learned that this is what everyone wants, and that almost nobody gets it. The last real thing his father had said to him had already happened, in a road cut, at a run, with the world coming apart: keep the ugly shape, stop trying to be good at it.",
